    "text": "Back in 2002, my buddy lent me his mp3 player everyday during my high school drafting class and \"a subtle dagger\" popped up on the list. It got me hooked and at the time I thought this was what peak talent sounds like. However, I couldn't have foreseen this creative journey that Thrice has taken me on. If you're reading this, thank you for all the years of fantastic music and staying true to yourselves. See you in Detroit.",
